]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, the middle had August to September at 63% of normal and July to August at 78%. Grid 26914 saw its driest year in 1965, at 71% of normal.</p>"}
